* GF180 1.8V 7-Stage Wide-Tuning-Range Closed-Loop Type-II Charge-Pump Ring PLL
* Derived from aicdb/pll-gen-opus5.5 (pll_ring__1v8V__100M-1G_at_180M architecture)
* - 7-stage current-starved inverter ring VCO + 6-bit PMOS current DAC + accumulation-mode MOS varactors
*   Tuning range: 65.8 MHz (code 0) .. 152.7 MHz (half full-scale code 32) .. 218.6 MHz (code 63) (~3.3x)
* - Vth-referenced bias + 20 uA current-steering charge pump + VC hold switch
* - 3rd-order passive MIM/poly loop filter (R=45k, C1=6.0pF, C2=0.5pF)
* - Custom thin-oxide TSPC /2/3 prescaler + 161-cell GF180 standard-cell PFD/divider/6-bit SAR AFC

.subckt pll_amos g w c_width=1e-6 c_length=1e-6
.param ar={cap_nmos_03v3_b_corner*c_width*c_length}
Ex x 0 g w 1
Rs x y 10
Cs y 0 1p
Bq g w I = (v(x)-v(y))*1e11*ar*(0.002458+0.001533*tanh(1.515152*v(g,w)+0.560606))
.ends


